{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographer private lives (摄影师私生活).\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest description is explicit: user wants actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. They do NOT want equipment promotions/marketing content or photographer private life content.\n\nLooking at the candidates, I can identify several content types based on descriptions:\n1. **市场观察 (Market observation)** - These are about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements, gifts, packaging, reservation benefits. These are equipment promotions/marketing → NOT wanted per explicit interest.\n2. **专题观察 (Special topic observation)** - About photography exhibition curation, author biography, artwork circulation, art activity historical background and viewing experience. These are about photographer/art history → closer to photographer private life/art history, NOT actual shooting methods.\n3. **条件与原理 (Conditions and principles)** - Explains from light, imaging, and visual relationships; explains variable interactions and applicability conditions; analyzes when common intuitions fail. → This matches the interest (成像原理, 实际拍摄方法).\n4. **操作记录 (Operation records)** - Fix composition and light, change shooting parameters one by one, record corresponding images, compare highlights/shadows/subject details, adjust settings. → This matches actual shooting methods and adjustments.\n5. **概念速览 (Concept overview)** - Lists common concepts, briefly explains phenomena, provides question catalog for further reading. → This is learning-oriented, matches interest.\n\nSo the user's interest explicitly wants: 实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整 (actual shooting methods, imaging principles, adjustments under different conditions).\n\nThe content types that match best:\n- **条件与原理 (Conditions and principles)** - directly about imaging principles and conditions\n- **操作记录 (Operation records)** - actual shooting methods and parameter adjustments\n- **概念速览 (Concept overview)** - learning concepts\n\nContent types that DON'T match (explicitly excluded):\n- **市场观察 (Market observation)** - equipment promotions → excluded\n- **专题观察 (Special topic observation)** - art exhibition/author biography/art history → this is about photographer/art history, not actual shooting methods. The interest says \"不关注...摄影师私生活\" (not interested in photographer private life). 专题观察 focuses on 策展线索、作者生平与作品流传 (curation, author biography, artwork circulation) - this is art history/author biography, which doesn't align with actual shooting methods.\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. Let me identify which candidates are which type.\n\nLet me categorize all 80 candidates. Actually, let me focus on selecting 20 that best match the interest.\n\nThe interest wants actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. The best matches are 条件与原理 and 操作记录 types. 概念速览 is also learning-oriented.\n\nLet me identify candidates of each type:\n\n**条件与原理 (Conditions and principles)** - description contains \"从光线、成像与视觉关系解释画面差异，说明变量间的作用和方法的适用条件，并分析常见直觉在哪些条件下失效\":\n- item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外\n- item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n- item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n- item-1a2494e4589c 逆光人像：阴天街道\n- item-2130f01f2f2c 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n- item-28b65f550fe1 微距景深：黄昏户外\n- item-287bd2a75b9a 雨天反光：低照度室内\n- item-2c0456eef787 夜景曝光：窗边自然光\n- item-2cbc282bedc9 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n- item-305dca4b57c4 静物布光：低照度室内\n- item-3ed55ed7b588 雨天反光：阴天街道\n- item-4ef7a9b648bc 夜景曝光：黄昏户外\n- item-5483802ef951 室内白平衡：窗边自然光\n- item-598ec31e514b 儿童抓拍：阴天街道\n- item-5c7e77e24c87 风光滤镜：窗边自然光\n\n**操作记录 (Operation records)** - description contains \"先固定构图和光线，逐次改变拍摄参数并记录对应画面\":\n- item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n- item-12a571ccfc9e 逆光人像：阴天街道\n- item-225af9fad31a 室内白平衡：阴天街道\n- item-2589e00e0e34 微距景深：低照度室内\n- item-2591e5ddcc17 微距景深：窗边自然光\n- item-274920178d43 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n- item-30b99cdb0a88 静物布光：阴天街道\n- item-3741cf536903 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n- item-38f75ee3d0a0 风光滤镜：阴天街道\n- item-3c7c2f99c9b1 运动追焦：窗边自然光\n- item-4fdd105846ab 街头构图：黄昏户外\n- item-5549ef7739ee 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n- item-5ccdd6fcc600 夜景曝光：低照度室内\n- item-5eb9bdedd6fe 微距景深：阴天街道\n\n**概念速览 (Concept overview)** - description contains \"列举...常用概念，简要说明...可能遇到的现象，为进一步阅读提供问题目录\":\n- item-09e96ac6aea0 微距景深：黄昏户外\n- item-0ca34ef0a880 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n- item-1b824b8d4dec 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n- item-1b9b39a7ef86 儿童抓拍：阴天街道\n- item-224628e85f98 逆光人像：阴天街道\n- item-2272238187d9 静物布光：阴天街道\n- item-24351a134f2a 街头构图：阴天街道\n- item-258cf26f5a90 静物布光：低照度室内\n- item-3463b20cdb5c 风光滤镜：阴天街道\n- item-3fc285db25a7 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n- item-41b73eff5c39 夜景曝光：黄昏户外\n- item-4a3715896d61 运动追焦：阴天街道\n- item-4c7dd3f82687 夜景曝光：窗边自然光\n- item-4fd4b9f7f81d 微距景深：低照度室内\n- item-55c98482739b 夜景曝光：低照度室内\n- item-5b90f11f0d74 室内白平衡：窗边自然光\n\n**市场观察 (Market observation)** - equipment promotions → EXCLUDED per interest:\n- item-014950ee574d, item-07bfbf16235d, item-090691086c5b, item-0b78ff27e538, item-143c3c5732d6, item-29e667691338, item-2c5a1d4489d6, item-3544c51e8163, item-36ae2f584661, item-37ed1c52f098, item-52069778a94c, item-6585d2bdd49d\n\n**专题观察 (Special topic observation)** - art exhibition/author biography/art history → doesn't match actual shooting methods:\n- item-03a565217024, item-064ccfdc15e3, item-0a19145321ef, item-11c4e3cb9cf2, item-11d6f8fe3226, item-16a7440356e6, item-2044482a2166, item-23de96f8a693, item-289fcb059574, item-29e183b710c7, item-2ed99b702e15, item-31a0f479e1ba, item-35e62f2ab730, item-37e6ef067bde, item-400635bfb9e5, item-42a655938746, item-47f11335a5e6, item-4ac35ecdd327, item-4fa6f1e97889, item-51a0472595e3, item-5f269b8d859e, item-6260b5b226c0, item-641ffc5aaebd\n\nSo the candidates tha